    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2454188195,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-d7627527c13c",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1332.0,
      "y": 243.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 157.5,
      "seed": 285534,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Read in place\nReading in place means that Snowflake queries\nthe Iceberg files where the sink wrote them.\nThe usual alternative copies the records into\ntables that Snowflake owns. Snowpipe\n(Snowflake's file loader) and the Snowflake\nKafka connector both work this way. A common\ncopy setup is an exporter that writes files to\nS3, plus Snowpipe to load them.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-d7627527c13c",
      "originalText": "Read in place\nReading in place means that Snowflake queries the Iceberg files where the sink wrote them. The usual alternative copies the records into tables that Snowflake owns. Snowpipe (Snowflake's file loader) and the Snowflake Kafka connector both work this way. A common copy setup is an exporter that writes files to S3, plus Snowpipe to load them.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "read-in-place"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3596514562,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-5a81790a6082",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1928.8,
      "y": 82.25,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 307215,
      "groupIds": [],
