    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6176549187,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-a36087821b39",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1094.4,
      "y": 956.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 193.20000000000002,
      "height": 455.0,
      "seed": 258854,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Catalog-linked database\nA catalog-linked\ndatabase is a Snowflake\ndatabase that mirrors\none or more namespaces\nof a remote Iceberg\ncatalog. Each namespace\nappears as a schema,\nand each table appears\nas an Iceberg table.\n\nSnowflake polls the\ncatalog, every 30\nseconds by default. It\nfinds new tables on its\nown, and it picks up\neach table's new\ncommits. No table needs\nits own setup in\nSnowflake. The\n[Snowflake guide](https\n://docs.snowflake.com/e\nn/user-guide/tables-ice\nberg-catalog-linked-dat\nabase) describes the\noptions.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-a36087821b39",
      "originalText": "Catalog-linked database\nA catalog-linked database is a Snowflake database that mirrors one or more namespaces of a remote Iceberg catalog. Each namespace appears as a schema, and each table appears as an Iceberg table.\n\nSnowflake polls the catalog, every 30 seconds by default. It finds new tables on its own, and it picks up each table's new commits. No table needs its own setup in Snowflake. The [Snowflake guide](https://docs.snowflake.com/en/user-guide/tables-iceberg-catalog-linked-database) describes the options.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "catalog-linked-database"
      }
    },
