    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6164645746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-13ba88aacf7a",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1332.0,
      "y": 1102.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 386.40000000000003,
      "height": 245.0,
      "seed": 224537,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CDC source connector\nReads the database's recorded changes and\nwrites one Kafka record for each changed row.\n\nUse a CDC source when the data lives as rows\nin an operational database, not as events.\nEquipment lists, status changes, and\nmaintenance records are typical examples. Some\nmachines may have no device that sends events.\nThen their rows are the only record of which\nmachines exist and how they change. CDC reads\nthese tables without changing them, and it\nruns on Kafka Connect, the same framework as\nthe sinks.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-13ba88aacf7a",
      "originalText": "CDC source connector\nReads the database's recorded changes and writes one Kafka record for each changed row.\n\nUse a CDC source when the data lives as rows in an operational database, not as events. Equipment lists, status changes, and maintenance records are typical examples. Some machines may have no device that sends events. Then their rows are the only record of which machines exist and how they change. CDC reads these tables without changing them, and it runs on Kafka Connect, the same framework as the sinks.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "cdc-source-connector"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9050906927,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-61eb640f36fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1920.4,
      "y": 1038.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 100.0,
