      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8283644921,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-b3e91aa6be5c",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1932.4,
      "y": 2505.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 76.0,
      "height": 997.5,
      "seed": 155664,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inputs\nThe read\nside\ntakes two\ninputs:\neach\ntable's\ncurrent\nmetadata\nfrom the\ncatalog,\nand the\nfiles in\nS3 that\nthe\nmetadata\nlists.\n\nSnowflake\nreaches\nthe\ncatalog\nthrough a\ncatalog i\nntegratio\nn. This\nSnowflake\nobject\nholds the\ncatalog's\naddress\nand name,\nand the\nOAuth\nclient\nthat\nSnowflake\nsigns in\nwith. The\nclient\nbelongs\nto its\nown princ\nipal,\nwith a\nread-only\ncatalog\nrole.\nThat\nprincipal\nis\nseparate\nfrom the\nsink's pr\nincipal,\nwhich can\nwrite.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b3e91aa6be5c",
      "originalText": "Inputs\nThe read side takes two inputs: each table's current metadata from the catalog, and the files in S3 that the metadata lists.\n\nSnowflake reaches the catalog through a catalog integration. This Snowflake object holds the catalog's address and name, and the OAuth client that Snowflake signs in with. The client belongs to its own principal, with a read-only catalog role. That principal is separate from the sink's principal, which can write.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "snowflake-inputs"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4297651106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-bf907cbe876f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1920.4,
      "y": 2586.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 100.0,
      "height": 41.5,
      "seed": 89561,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3,
        "value": 8
      },
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-bf907cbe876f"
        },
        {
          "id": "edge-884a15f0dd31",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "snowflake-outputs"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7316282446,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-bf907cbe876f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1932.4,
      "y": 2586.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 76.0,
      "height": 962.5,
      "seed": 607017,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Outputs\nThe\noutput is\na set of\nIceberg\ntables\nthat a\nSnowflake\nrole can\nquery\nonce it\nhas\nSELECT.\ndbt reads\nthem as\nsources.\nSnowflake\nstores\nnone of\nthe rows:\neach\nquery\nreads the\nfiles of\nthe\ntable's\ncurrent\nsnapshot\nfrom S3.\n\nCatalog\nnames are\ncase-sens\nitive and\nusually l\nowercase.\nSnowflake\nturns\nunquoted\nnames\ninto uppe\nrcase, so\nqueries\nand dbt\nsources\nmust\nquote the\nschema\nand table\nnames,\nfor\nexample \"\nsensors\".\n\"readings\n\".",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-bf907cbe876f",
      "originalText": "Outputs\nThe output is a set of Iceberg tables that a Snowflake role can query once it has SELECT. dbt reads them as sources. Snowflake stores none of the rows: each query reads the files of the table's current snapshot from S3.\n\nCatalog names are case-sensitive and usually lowercase. Snowflake turns unquoted names into uppercase, so queries and dbt sources must quote the schema and table names, for example \"sensors\".\"readings\".",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "snowflake-outputs"
      }
    },
